<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Soviic — You're on the waitlist</title>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy:#0B1929;
      --navy-mid:#0F2236;
      --cyan:#22D3EE;
      --muted:#7CA3C0;
      --white:#F0F8FF;
      --border:rgba(34,211,238,0.12);
      --card:rgba(15,34,54,0.7);
      --cyan-subtle:rgba(34,211,238,0.08);
    }

    * {
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background:var(--navy);
      color:var(--white);
      min-height:100vh;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:24px;
    }

    .card {
      max-width:780px;
      width:100%;
      background:var(--card);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:24px;
      padding:56px;
      text-align:left;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .badge {
      display:inline-block;
      font-family:'DM Mono';
      font-size:0.75rem;
      color:var(--cyan);
      background:var(--cyan-subtle);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      padding:6px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      margin-bottom:24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size:2rem;
      margin-bottom:24px;
      letter-spacing:-0.03em;
      text-align:center;
    }

    h1 span {
      color:var(--cyan);
    }

    p {
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-bottom:16px;
      font-weight:300;
      white-space:pre-line;
    }

    .email {
      color:var(--cyan);
      font-weight:600;
    }

    .btn {
      display:inline-block;
      background:var(--cyan);
      color:var(--navy);
      padding:12px 20px;
      border-radius:12px;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-weight:700;
      margin-top:20px;
      transition:0.2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform:translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(34,211,238,0.2);
    }

    .socials {
      margin-top:36px;
      display:grid;
      gap:8px;
      font-size:0.9rem;
    }

    a {
      color:var(--cyan);
      text-decoration:none;
    }

    a:hover {
      opacity:0.8;
    }

    .footer-note {
      margin-top:28px;
      font-size:0.8rem;
      color:var(--muted);
      text-align:center;
    }

    .content {
      margin-top:24px;
      white-space:pre-line;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">

    <div class="badge">You're In</div>

    <h1>Welcome to <span>Soviic</span></h1>

    <p style="text-align:center;">
      We’ve added: <span class="email" id="email">your@email.com</span>
    </p>

    <div class="content">

Hi,

Thank you for joining the SOVIIC Early Access waitlist.

SOVIIC is being built for small businesses that are tired of disconnected tools, spreadsheet chaos, and repetitive manual work.

Most businesses don't need more software. They need the systems they already use to work together better.

Our goal is simple:

• Connect your existing tools and workflows
• Reduce repetitive manual tasks
• Prevent information from falling through the cracks
• Make automation practical for real small businesses

As we continue building SOVIIC, we'll occasionally share product updates, workflow ideas, and opportunities to participate in early testing.

You'll be among the first to know when early access becomes available.

One quick question:

What is the most repetitive or frustrating process in your business today?

Simply reply to this email and let us know.

Thank you for joining us early.

— The SOVIIC Team

    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <a class="btn" href="/">Back to Home</a>
    </div>

    <div class="socials">
      <a href="https://x.com/soviicapp" target="_blank">X / Twitter</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/keith-williams-04414490" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/soviic2026" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61590826460678" target="_blank">Facebook</a>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@soviic" target="_blank">YouTube</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/keithwilliams0786-stack/soviic-website" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.producthunt.com/@keith_williams10" target="_blank">Product Hunt</a>
      <a href="https://www.reddit.com/user/soviic/" target="_blank">Reddit</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-note">
      We’ll keep you updated as SOVIIC grows.
    </div>

  </div>

  <script>
    const email = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get("email");
    if (email) {
      document.getElementById("email").textContent = email;
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
